Error [E3302]: Target `web` is not available.
 Why: Rustc doesn't have the standard library for this target compiled in, or the target triple is not recognised.
 Fix: Run `jet self doctor --target <triple>` to see what's missing, or `rustup target add <triple>` to install it.
